### Variables (cambia el host si usas Docker en otro puerto: 8080 local, 8082 en el compose de pruebas)
@host = http://localhost:8080
@token = PEGA_AQUI_EL_TOKEN

### Catálogo (público)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/pokeapi/pokemon?page=0&size=20

### Detalle por id o nombre (público)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/pokeapi/pokemon/pikachu

### Registro
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "ash", "email": "ash@example.com", "password": "Pikachu123" }

### Login (copia accessToken en @token)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "demo", "password": "Demo1234!" }

### Quién soy
GET {{host}}/api/v1/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Sincronizar un Pokémon (201 si es nuevo, 200 si ya existía)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/pokemon/sync/25
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Listado local con filtros (público)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/pokemon?page=0&size=10&region=kanto&tag=starter

### Editar campos propios con control de versión
PUT {{host}}/api/v1/pokemon/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
If-Match: "0"

{ "localName": "Semillita", "region": "Kanto", "tags": ["starter", "grass"] }

### Editar parcialmente (PATCH): solo los campos enviados cambian
PATCH {{host}}/api/v1/pokemon/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "region": "Johto" }

### Borrar (solo ADMIN; con token de demo devuelve 403)
DELETE {{host}}/api/v1/pokemon/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Sincronización masiva (solo ADMIN)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/pokemon/sync?from=1&to=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
